tion  The immediate interpretation findings were not discussed with the  patient  The preliminary results were communicated to Dr  Specht by Dr  R   Balassanian at 5 o clock p m       Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on Friday  REMOVED_MONTH 15   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 11 50 09AM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or corrected the diagnoses     Specimen  Patient Evaluation  T  Management  Specimen   see also MN 10  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  of corresponding FNAB   Specimen   see also MN 10  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  of corresponding FNAB        report_end  , Yes.
